NOTICE for native_tmol (torch-free CPU energy kernels)
======================================================

This component reimplements the ref2015 pairwise energy math (fa_atr / fa_rep / fa_lk /
fa_elec / lk_ball / hbond) as standalone, torch-free C++ CPU kernels. The scalar math is
ported verbatim from two Apache-2.0 sources; this NOTICE satisfies Apache License 2.0
section 4(d) (the upstream tmol repository ships no NOTICE of its own).

