Scope: code only. No energy parameter tables are vendored.
-----------------------------------------------------------

These kernels reimplement only the energy CODE. They vendor no numeric parameter tables. The
ljlk/elec/lk_ball/hbond parameter values, and the per-pair hbond polynomials, descend from the
Rosetta database and are distributed under the Rosetta Software Non-Commercial License
Agreement (not an OSI open-source license). They are supplied to the kernels at runtime by the
caller (resolved from a user-supplied parameter database, or folded into an offline parity
fixture exported under the user's own Rosetta license). The offline parity fixtures used for
in-container validation are NOT part of this package and are not redistributed here.

Rosetta is developed by the Rosetta Commons; commercial licensing is handled by University of
Washington CoMotion (license@uw.edu).
